   "text": "ThundR Plugin Adapter 0.1.0"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Integrated plugin adapter for all bots and AI, certainly Muse: communication, diagnostics, analysis, debugging, repairs, updates, and coding and visual integrations. Protocol rzl.thundr.plugin.v1 over rzl.link.v1 envelopes.",
   "tag": "declared"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "LAW: bots never sign. Keys never leave the device. Decider approval before anything changes a device. Repairs and updates are propose-first. Fail-closed allowlist. Never erase.",
   "tag": "declared"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Neo only: Xcode builds, Swift compilation, RTHUNDR.app, the old non-pure brain inference (excluded from the pure .RZL project), Face ID unlocks, Яloader installs. Shell: diagnostics, analysis, purity scan, tests, proposals, Trackers.",
   "tag": "declared"
  }
 ]
